# Files that don't need a Wrappit note, one pattern per line.
#   name.ext   matches that name in any folder
#   folder/    matches a whole folder, in any folder
#   a/b/*.txt  matches from the repo root; ** matches any number of folders
# Lines starting with # are comments. Negation (!) is not supported.

